1
00:00:46,666 --> 00:00:52,666
Powder Keg is a action, war film directed by Alejandro González Iñárritu.

2
00:01:33,333 --> 00:01:39,333
The Driver is drafted by the UN to rescue a wounded war photographer
named Harvey Jacobs from out of hostile territory.

3
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:26,000
While they are leaving Jacobs tells the Driver about the horrors he saw as a
photographer, but he regrets his inability to help war victims.

4
00:03:06,666 --> 00:03:12,666
Jacobs answers the driver curiosity about why he is a
photographer by saying how his mother taught him to see.

5
00:03:53,333 --> 00:03:59,333
He gives the Driver the film needed for a New York Times story
and also his dog tags to give to his mother.

6
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:46,000
When they reach the border, they are confronted by a guard who begins to draw arms
as Jacobs begins taking pictures, trying to get himself killed.

7
00:05:26,666 --> 00:05:32,666
The Driver drives through a hail of gunfire to the border, but
finds Jacobs killed by a bullet through the seat.

8
00:06:13,333 --> 00:06:19,333
The Driver arrives in America to visit Jacobs' mother and share the news of him winning the
Pulitzer prize and hand over the dog tags, only to discover that she is blind.

9
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:06,000
The Driver, played by Clive Owen.

10
00:07:46,666 --> 00:07:52,666
Harvey Jacobs, played by Stellan Skarsgård.

11
00:08:33,333 --> 00:08:39,333
Mother, played by Lois Smith.

12
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:26,000
Paramilitary 1, played by Javier Zaragoza.

13
00:10:06,666 --> 00:10:12,666
Paramilitary 2, played by Luis Francisco Escobedo.

14
00:10:53,333 --> 00:10:59,333
Paramilitary 3, played by Gilberto Barraza.

15
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:46,000
The BMW film series The Hire consists of eight short films (averaging about ten
minutes each) produced for internet distribution in 2001 and 2002.

16
00:12:26,666 --> 00:12:32,666
A form of branded content, the shorts were directed by popular filmmakers from around the globe and starred
Clive Owen as "the Driver" while highlighting the performance aspects of various BMW automobiles.

17
00:13:13,333 --> 00:13:19,333
The series made a comeback in 2016, fourteen years after its original run ended.
